 R←Test_Misc_006(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;version;outer;inner
⍝ Exercise `Version`: first the real one, then all three branches in namespaces built for the purpose
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 version←##.HashPasswords.Version
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢'^\d+\.\d+\.\d+'⎕S 0⊢version

 outer←⎕NS''
 inner←outer.⎕NS''
 {}inner.⎕FX ##.HashPasswords.⎕NR'Version'
 →T.PassesIf''≡inner.Version                         ⍝ No TatinVars anywhere: not loaded by Tatin

 {}'TatinVars'outer.⎕NS''
 outer.TatinVars.CONFIG←'{version: "1.2.3+4"}'
 →T.PassesIf'1.2.3+4'≡inner.Version                  ⍝ TatinVars in the parent

 {}'TatinVars'inner.⎕NS''
 inner.TatinVars.CONFIG←'{version: "5.6.7+8"}'
 →T.PassesIf'5.6.7+8'≡inner.Version                  ⍝ TatinVars in the namespace itself wins

 R←T._OK
